   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Counting and saying ages",
   "texto": [
    "In bokmål the modern form is used: the tens go before the units and are written together: tjueen (21), trettito (32). The ancient «enogtyve» form exists, but to learn we will use tjueen.",
    "To tell the age, the order er + number + år: Jeg er trettito år is maintained. Sju and syv, tjue and tyve, tretti and tredve are accepted variants; here are taught sju, tjue and tretti."
   ]
  },
